ong-wyd1739-wang-preface"},{"start":18,"end":19,"surface":"褒","kind":"person","id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface:p003:m0018","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本序具名角色；原文/字/諡按本來源範圍，身份同指不等同所敘遠祖譜為真。","paragraph_id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface:p003","chapter_id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface"},{"start":20,"end":22,"surface":"子淵","kind":"person","id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface:p003:m0020","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本序具名角色；原文/字/諡按本來源範圍，身份同指不等同所敘遠祖譜為真。","paragraph_id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface:p003","chapter_id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-liang041-bao-maternal-grandfather","subject_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","predicate":"grandfather","object_person_id":"hb9_2gq_205","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"外祖司空袁昂","lineage":"maternal","mother_person_id":null},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-041","source_id":"s-liangshu041-ws1512987","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p005","quote":"子褒，字子漢，七歲能屬文。外祖司空袁昂愛之，謂賓客曰：「此兒當成吾宅相。」弱冠舉秀才，除秘書郎、太子舍人，以父憂去職。服闋，襲封南昌侯，除武昌王文學、太子洗馬，兼東宮管記，遷司徒屬，秘書丞，出爲安成內史。太清中，侯景陷京城，江州刺史當陽公大心舉州附賊，賊轉寇南中，褒猶據郡拒守。大寶二年，世祖命徵褒赴江陵，旣至，以爲忠武將軍、南平內史，俄遷吏部尚書、侍中。承聖二年，遷尚書右僕射，仍參掌選事，又加侍中。其年，遷左僕射，參掌如故。三年，江陵陷，入于周。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p005:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p005:m0017"}],"interpretation_note":"保原文親屬詞；不補原文未名母親、婚配、年份或排行。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null},{"id":"a-xintang072-wyd-bao_zhou-father","subject_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"lineage":"paternal","source_term":"生褒","source_clause_binding":{"kind":